ебное заведение, расположенное в Алма-Ате. Основан в 1934 году. С 1991 года носит имя средневекового философа и ученого Абу́ Насра Аль-Фараби.","contentmodel":"wikitext","pagelanguage":"ru","pagelanguagehtmlcode":"ru","pagelanguagedir":"ltr","touched":"2026-09-14T21:43:58Z","lastrevid":154482347,"length":44143,"fullurl":"https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%9A%D0%B0%D0%B7%D0%B0%D1%85%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%B8%D0%B9_%D0%BD%D0%B0%D1%86%D0%B8%D0%BE%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%BB%D1%8C%D0%BD%D1%8B%D0%B9_%D1%83%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B2%D0%B5%D1%80%D1%81%D0%B8%D1%82%D0%B5%D1%82","editurl":"https://ru.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%D0%9A%D0%B0%D0%B7%D0%B0%D1%85%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%B8%D0%B9_%D0%BD%D0%B0%D1%86%D0%B8%D0%BE%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%BB%D1%8C%D0%BD%D1%8B%D0%B9_%D1%83%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B2%D0%B5%D1%80%D1%81%D0%B8%D1%82%D0%B5%D1%82&action=edit","canonicalurl":"https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%9A%D0%B0%D0%B7%D0%B0%D1%85%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%B8%D0%B9_%D0%BD%D0%B0%D1%86%D0%B8%D0%BE%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%BB%D1%8C%D0%BD%D1%8B%D0%B9_%D1%83%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B2%D0%B5%D1%80%D1%81%D0%B8%D1%82%D0%B5%D1%82"}]}},"https://en.wikipedia.org/w/api.php?format=json&formatversion=2&action=query&prop=extracts%7Cinfo&inprop=url&exintro=1&explaintext=1&redirects=1&titles=Al-Farabi+Kazakh+National+University":{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":2829824,"ns":0,"title":"Al-Farabi Kazakh National University","extract":"Al-Farabi Kazakh National University (Kazakh: Әл-Фараби атындағы Қазақ ұлттық университеті), also called KazNU or KazGU, is a national research university located in Almaty, Kazakhstan. Named after philosopher and scholar al-Farabi, it is one of the country's largest universities.\nKazNU is Kazakhstan's oldest classical university. It was established on November 13, 1933 by a resolution from the Soviet Communist Party's Kazakh Regional Committee. In 2023, KazNU was ranked 150th in the world by the QS World University Rankings.\nIn 2001, KazNU was classified as a \"national\" university by the government of Kazakhstan. More than 20,000 students study at KazNU, and there are more than 2,500 faculty members working there, including professors, associate professors, 400 Doctors of Science, and more than 800 Candidates of Science.\nIn 2021, KazNU was named one of the Top 500 Universities in the World.","contentmodel":"wikitext","pagelanguage":"en","pagelanguagehtmlcode":"en","pagelanguagedir":"ltr","touched":"2026-09-16T18:08:56Z","lastrevid":1374369450,"length":30314,"fullurl":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Al-Farabi_Kazakh_National_University","editurl":"https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Al-Farabi_Kazakh_National_University&action=edit","canonicalurl":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Al-Farabi_Kazakh_National_University"}]}},"https://www.wikidata.org/w/api.php?format=json&formatversion=2&action=wbgetentities&ids=Q1513804&props=labels%7Caliases%7Cdescriptions%7Cclaims%7Csitelinks&languages=ru%7Cen%7Ckk":{"entities":{"Q1513804":{"type":"item","id":"Q1513804","labels":{"ru":{"language":"ru","value":"Казахский национальный исследовательский технический университет имени К. И. Сатпаева"},"en":{"language":"en","value":"Satbayev University"},"kk":{"language":"kk","value":"Қаныш Сәтбаев атындағы Қазақ ұлттық техникалық университеті"}},"descriptions":{"en":{"language":"en","value":"university"},"ru":{"language":"ru","value":"университет в Алма-Ате, Казахстан"}},"aliases":{"ru":[{"language":"ru","value":"Казахский горно-металлургический институт"},{"language":"ru","value":"Казахский национальный технический университет"},{"language":"ru","value":"Казахский политехнический институт им. Ленина"},{"language":"ru","value":"Казахский политехнический институт им. В.И. Ленина"},{"language":"ru","value":"Казахский политехнический институт"},{"language":"ru","value":"Казахский политехнический институт им. В. И. Ленина"},{"language":"ru","value":"КазНТУ"},{"language":"ru","value":"Казахский Национальный технический университет им. К. И. Сатпаева"}],"kk":[{"language":"kk","value":"ҚазҰТУ"},{"language